aysinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784740/extras/1fde959341c7691587120a52a5ed36da.poster.avif?t=1782750731\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784740/extras/1fde959341c7691587120a52a5ed36da.webm?t=1782750731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784740/extras/1fde959341c7691587120a52a5ed36da.mp4?t=1782750731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living Journal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zite exists entirely within the Pages of a hand-crafted journal. Roads are drawn directly across the Page to shape your expansion, locations unfold like sketches brought to life, and the Blite consumes the Page itself as shadow spreads across the journal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Powerful Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover combinations of locations and effects to create thriving cities capable of surviving harsh seasons. Adapt your strategy every run as new cards, events, and challenges emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784740/extras/331274a9bd4874050520637b95077d8e.poster.avif?t=1782750731\" width=844 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784740/extras/331274a9bd4874050520637b95077d8e.webm?t=1782750731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784740/extras/331274a9bd4874050520637b95077d8e.mp4?t=1782750731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-like deckbuilding combined with turn-based city building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw roads across Pages to expand your settlement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build synergies between locations and cards in 3 decks with their own flavor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through all four seasons to complete a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Zite by building efficient and thriving cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode for infinite runs and score chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard Mode for additional challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted origami and paper visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized runs with new layouts, strategies, and combinations each game.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Create the city of Zite one Page at a time in this rogue-like deckbuilder. Expand your city with cards and hand-drawn roads, discover powerful synergies, and resist a spreading darkness threatening to consume the journal and return its Pages to shadow.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784740/dcaca033b64c6f82214507bfa83120d9864902b0/header.jpg?t=1782750731", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784740/dca816e61b57f45e1c53b70fa917291c01e468ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782750731", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4784740/dca816e61b57f45e1c53b70fa917291c01e468ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782750731", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 840M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requir